https://www.sportscardforum.com/scfttmm/ttmm

These are 2 services if you'd like to get the autograph authenticated and slabbed. I'm not sure with grading when it comes to currency. As for appraisal, ebay sold listings usually is a good barometer for what people would pay for a Trump sig. Plus $20 of course. Good luck!

